      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Google Sheets KYB Evaluation + Reports on Drive\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs on a schedule, reads company records from Google Sheets, and processes each row through Ambriel for KYB evaluation. It updates the source sheet with evaluation results, checks whether a report file is available, then downloads and uploads the report to Google Drive.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure the Schedule Trigger with the desired run frequency.\n- [ ] Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet, sheet, and row range containing the companies to evaluate.\n- [ ] Configure Ambriel credentials and map the required company fields from the sheet into the evaluation and report-file nodes.\n- [ ] Connect Google Drive credentials and choose the destination folder for uploaded reports.\n- [ ] Verify the If condition matches the expected Ambriel response field that indicates a report file is available.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the Google Sheets column mappings, Ambriel evaluation inputs, report availability condition, and Google Drive destination folder to match your KYB process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8d1e4ca9-462a-4e94-907e-721f342aaf99",
